# To determine which is more significantly influenced, we can look at the rate of change

# Compute differences in percentage from year to year
latvian_changes = [percent_latvian[i+1] - percent_latvian[i] for i in range(len(percent_latvian)-1)]
russian_changes = [percent_russian[i+1] - percent_russian[i] for i in range(len(percent_russian)-1)]

# Find the average change (rate of change) for each
